{"key":"allod/jigran","relations":[{"id":"people","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/first","title":"Anwerber","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/baron","title":"Baron Virril","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/bson","title":"Dartas","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/firez","title":"Firez","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/nekro","title":"Jaminin","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/hero","title":"Kir","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/stark","title":"Meister Stark","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/doctor","title":"Onkel Rad","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/deva","title":"Tai-Ilara","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/junofil","title":"Tui-Len","variant":""}],"title":"Bewohner"},{"id":"region","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/gz31j","title":"Dar-Leanos und Umgebung","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz32j","title":"Der Spion","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz33j","title":"Festung Dar-Ulgorn","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz32j","title":"Insel des Todes","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz1r","title":"Lager des Anwerbers","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz35j","title":"Sadrok und Umgebung","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz31j","title":"Stadt Dar-Leanos","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz36j","title":"Thronsaal","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz34d1","title":"Versteck der June","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz1g","title":"Westliches Schlossumland","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz34j","title":"Zwei Flüsse","variant":""}],"title":"Orte"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Jigran</h1><h2>Schauplatz</h2><p>Jigran ist Kirs Heimat, eine abgeschlossene Insel im ewigen Herbst und im Krieg zwischen Kania und Khadagan. Firez’ Nekromantie hat Felder und Wälder ausgezehrt. Die Bevölkerung lebt überwiegend in befestigten Städten, draußen streifen Untote umher. Kir kehrt mit Kel durch einen alten Zugang zurück, unterstützt Baron Virril und erfährt das Schicksal der zurückgelassenen Joons. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]</p><h2>Quellen</h2><p>Grundlage sind die Originaldialoge und Weltbeschreibungen. Die Quellenzahlen verweisen auf die unten aufgeführten Szenen.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Quellen</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Weltbeschreibung · Jigran (allod jigran)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_254)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/baron\">Baron Virril</a> (briefing brief_304)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/junofil\">Tui-Len</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_341)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/firez\">Firez</a> (briefing brief_349)</td></tr></table><h2>Bewohner</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/first\">Anwerber</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/baron\">Baron Virril</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/bson\">Dartas</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/firez\">Firez</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/nekro\">Jaminin</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/stark\">Meister Stark</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/doctor\">Onkel Rad</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/deva\">Tai-Ilara</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/junofil\">Tui-Len</a></td></tr></table><h2>Orte</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz31j\">Dar-Leanos und Umgebung</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz32j\">Der Spion</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz33j\">Festung Dar-Ulgorn</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz